Description: IBus speech dictation engine using sherpa-onnx
 Local streaming speech-to-text as an IBus input method, powered by
 sherpa-onnx (Nemotron online transducer).
 .
 Install this package, open IME Preferences (or run ibus-setup-sherpa-onnx)
 to pick a model and options, then ibus restart / add the IME (see README).
 .
 ASR model weights are not included; download via Preferences or the fetch script.
